pandoc3: pandoc-quotes-pandoc3.lua is pandoc-quotes.lua with the two tests of a metadata value's type made as pandoc 3 needs (`pandoc.utils.type(meta) == 'Inlines'`, `== 'List'`, where the original tests `meta.t == 'MetaInlines'`, `'MetaList'`): since pandoc 2.17 a metadata value has no `t` in Lua, so the original fails (see NOTES.md) on every document that sets quot-marks or quot-marks-by-lang. With the fix its own tests pass under pandoc 3.14, as they did under pandoc 2; the cases are what the fixed one makes.
